    },
    {
      "id": "study_cult_tract",
      "cell": [
        1,
        12
      ],
      "kind": "book",
      "label": "a black pamphlet",
      "model": "pamphlet",
      "codex": "death_house_cult_tract",
      "text": "A thin pamphlet, printed privately, with no author's name. It promises that the Lord of the valley rewards those who feed the land, and that the patient and the hungry will be raised up when he returns their gifts. It ends with a single line set in heavy type: one must die, that the rest may live forever. Someone has underlined it twice."
    },
